---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import LeadBlock from '../components/LeadBlock.astro';
import subjects from '../data/subjects.json';
import { teamStats } from '../lib';
const { tutors, examiners, heads } = teamStats();
const siteCount = subjects.filter((s) => s.site && !s.external).length;
---
<Base title="About aleveltutors.online | Online A-level Tutoring from Winchester" description="aleveltutors.online is run by Tom Whitburn, who has taught A-level Biology for nearly 30 years. A small team of experienced A-level specialists teaching online, one to one.">
  <section class="page-head">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="eyebrow">About</div>
      <h1>About us</h1>
      <p>A small team of experienced A-level specialists, run by a teacher.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="block">
    <div class="wrap prose">
      <p>aleveltutors.online is run by Tom Whitburn from Winchester. Tom has taught A-level Biology in sixth form colleges for nearly 30 years and tutors through <a href="https://www.alevelbiologytutor.com/">alevelbiologytutor.com</a>. aleveltutors.online brings together experienced specialists in the other A-level subjects.</p>
      <p>There are {tutors} tutors. Each teaches the subject they know best. Most teach, or have taught, A level in sixth form colleges; {examiners} have marked A-level exams for the exam boards and {heads} have led a department.</p>
      <h2>What we believe</h2>
      <p>Good tutoring is not about racing through content. It is about finding exactly where a student is losing marks, explaining it clearly, and practising until it holds. That takes someone who has taught the course many times and knows how it is examined.</p>
      <p>We also think students should leave each lesson with something to keep. That is why every lesson is recorded, and why we have built free revision sites, {siteCount} so far, with every past-paper question sorted by topic, the mark schemes and the examiners’ comments. Anyone can use them, whether or not they have lessons with us. <a href="/free-revision/">Find yours</a>.</p>
      <h2>Talk to Tom</h2>
      <p>If you are unsure whether tutoring is the right step, or which subject to start with, send Tom a message. He reads every one himself.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <LeadBlock />
</Base>
